{
  "title": "Sahifa Sajjadiya 44: Welcoming Ramazan",
  "data": "الْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ الَّذِي هَدَانَا لِحَمْدِهٖ\nAL-HAMDU LILLAAHIL LADHEE HADAANAA LIHAMDIH\nPraise belongs to God who guided us to His praise\nوَجَعَلَنَا مِنْ اَهْلِهٖ لِنَكُونَ لِاِحْسَانِهٖ مِنَ الشَّاكِرِينَ\nWA JA'ALANAA MIN AHLIHEE LINAKOONA LI-IHSAANIHEE MINASH SHAAKIREEN\nand placed us among the people of praise, that we might be among the thankful for His beneficence\nوَلِيَجْزِيَنَا عَلَى ذَلِكَ جَزَاءَ الْمُحْسِنِينَ\nWA LIYAJZIYANAA A'LAA DHAALIKA JAZAA'AL MUHSINEEN\nand that He might recompense us for that with the recompense of the good-doers!\nوَالْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ الَّذِي حَبَانَا بِدِينِهٖ\nWAL HAMDU LILLAAHIL LADHEE HABAANAA BIDEENIH\nAnd praise belongs to God who showed favour to us through His religion,\nوَاخْتَصَّنَا بِمِلَّتِهٖ، وَسَبَّلَنَا فِي سُبُلِ اِحْسَانِهٖ\nWAKHTASSANAA BIMILLATIHEE WA SABBALANAA FEE SUBULI IHSAANIH\nsingled us out for His creed, and directed us onto the roads of His beneficence,\nلِنَسْلُكَهَا بِمَنِّهٖ اِلَى رِضْوَانِهٖ\nLINASLUKAHAA BIMANNIHEE ILAA RIDWAANIH\nin order that through His kindness we might travel upon them to His good pleasure,\nحَمْداً يَتَقَبَّلُهٗ مِنَّا، وَيَرْضَى بِهٖ عَنَّا\nHAMDAN YATAQABBALUHOO MINNAA WA YARDAA BIHEE A'NNAA\na praise which He will accept from us and through which He will be pleased with us!\nوَالْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ الَّذِي جَعَلَ مِنْ تِلْكَ السُّبُلِ شَهْرَهٗ شَهْرَ رَمَضَانَ\nWAL HAMDU LILLAAHIL LADHEE JA'ALA MIN TILKAS SUBULI SHAHRAHOO SHAHRA RAMADAAN\nAnd praise belongs to God who appointed among those roads His month, the month of Ramadan,\nشَهْرَ الصِّيَامِ، وَشَهْرَ الْاِسْلَامِ، وَشَهْرَ الطَّهُورِ\nSHAHRAS SIYAAMI WA SHAHRAL ISLAAMI WA SHAHRAT TAHOOR\nthe month of fasting, the month of submission, the month of purity,\nوَشَهْرَ التَّمْحِيصِ، وَشَهْرَ الْقِيَامِ\nWA SHAHRAT TAMHEESI WA SHAHRAL QIYAAM\nthe month of putting to test, the month of standing in prayer,\nالَّذِي اُنْزِلَ فِيهِ الْقُرْاٰنُ، هُدًى لِلنَّاسِ\nALLADHEE UNZILA FEEHIL QUR'AANU HUDAN LIN NAAS\n\"in which the Qur'an was sent down as guidance to the people,\nوَبَيِّنَاتٍ مِنَ الْهُدَى وَالْفُرْقَانِ\nWA BAYYINAATIN MINAL HUDAA WAL FURQAAN\nand as clear signs of the Guidance and the Separator\" (2:185)!\nفَاَبَانَ فَضِيلَتَهٗ عَلَى سَائِرِ الشُّهُورِ\nFA-ABAANA FADEELATAHOO A'LAA SAA'IRISH SHUHOOR\nHe clarified its excellence over other months\nبِمَا جَعَلَ لَهٗ مِنَ الْحُرُمَاتِ الْمَوْفُورَةِ، وَالْفَضَائِلِ الْمَشْهُورَةِ\nBIMAA JA'ALA LAHOO MINAL HURUMAATIL MAWFOORATI WAL FADAA'ILIL MASH-HOORAH\nby the many sacred things and well-known excellencies which He placed therein,\nفَحَرَّمَ فِيهِ مَا اَحَلَّ فِي غَيْرِهٖ اِعْظَاماً\nFAHARRAMA FEEHI MAA AHALLA FEE GHAYRIHEE I'ZAAMAA\nfor He made unlawful in it what He declared lawful in others to magnify it,\nوَحَجَرَ فِيهِ الْمَطَاعِمَ وَالْمَشَارِبَ اِكْرَاماً\nWA HAJARA FEEHIL MATAA'IMA WAL MASHAARIBA IKRAAMAA\nHe prohibited foods and drinks in it to honour it,\nوَجَعَلَ لَهٗ وَقْتاً بَيِّناً لَا يُجِيزُ جَلَّ وَعَزَّ اَنْ يُقَدَّمَ قَبْلَهٗ\nWA JA'ALA LAHOO WAQTAN BAYYINAN LAA YUJEEZU JALLA WA A'ZZA AN YUQADDAMA QABLAH\nand He appointed for it a clear time which He (majestic and mighty is He) allows not to be set forward\nوَلَا يَقْبَلُ اَنْ يُؤَخَّرَ عَنْهُ\nWA LAA YAQBALU AN YU'AKHKHARA A'NH\nand accepts not to be placed behind.\nثُمَّ فَضَّلَ لَيْلَةً وَاحِدَةً مِنْ لَيَالِيهِ عَلَى لَيَالِي اَلْفِ شَهْرٍ\nTHUMMA FADDALA LAYLATAN WAAHIDATAN MIN LAYAALEEHI A'LAA LAYAALEE ALFI SHAHR\nThen He made one of its nights surpass the nights of a thousand months\nوَسَمَّاهَا لَيْلَةَ الْقَدْرِ\nWA SAMMAAHAA LAYLATAL QADR\nand named it the Night of Decree;\nتَنَزَّلُ الْمَلَائِكَةُ وَالرُّوحُ فِيهَا بِاِذْنِ رَبِّهِمْ مِنْ كُلِّ اَمْرٍ\nTANAZZALUL MALAA'IKATU WAR ROOHU FEEHAA BI-IDHNI RABBIHIM MIN KULLI AMR\n\"in it the angels and the Spirit descend by the leave of their Lord upon every command,\nسَلَامٌ، دَائِمُ الْبَرَكَةِ اِلَى طُلُوعِ الْفَجْرِ\nSALAAMUN DAA'IMUL BARAKATI ILAA TULOO'IL FAJR\na peace\" (97:4-5) constant in blessings until the rising of the dawn\nعَلَى مَنْ يَشَاءُ مِنْ عِبَادِهٖ بِمَا اَحْكَمَ مِنْ قَضَائِهِ\nA'LAA MAN YASHAA'U MIN I'BAADIHEE BIMAA AHKAMA MIN QADAA'IH\nupon whomsoever He will of His servants according to the decision He has made firm.\nاللَّهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِهِ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALIH\nO God, bless Muhammad and his Household,\nوَاَلْهِمْنَا مَعْرِفَةَ فَضْلِهٖ وَاِجْلَالَ حُرْمَتِهٖ\nWA ALHIMNAA MA'RIFATA FADLIHEE WA IJLAALA HURMATIH\ninspire us with knowledge of its excellence, veneration of its inviolability,\nوَالتَّحَفُّظَ مِمَّا حَظَرْتَ فِيهِ\nWAT TAHAFFUZA MIMMAA HAZARTA FEEH\nand caution against what You have forbidden within it,\nوَاَعِنَّا عَلَى صِيَامِهٖ بِكَفِّ الْجَوَارِحِ عَنْ مَعَاصِيكَ\nWA A'INNAA A'LAA SIYAAMIHEE BIKAFFIL JAWAARIHI A'N MA'AASEEK\nand help us to fast in it by our restraining our limbs from acts of disobedience toward You\nوَاسْتِعْمَالِهَا فِيهِ بِمَا يُرْضِيكَ\nWASTI'MAALIHAA FEEHI BIMAA YURDEEK\nand our employing them in that which pleases You,\nحَتَّى لَا نُصْغِيَ بِاَسْمَاعِنَا اِلَى لَغْوٍ\nHATTAA LAA NUSGHIYA BI-ASMAA'INAA ILAA LAGHW\nso that we lend not our ears to idle talk\nوَلَا نُسْرِعَ بِاَبْصَارِنَا اِلَى لَهْوٍ\nWA LAA NUSRI'A BI-ABSAARINAA ILAA LAHW\nand hurry not with our eyes to diversion,\nوَحَتَّى لَا نَبْسُطَ اَيْدِيَنَا اِلَى مَحْظُورٍ\nWA HATTAA LAA NABSUTA AYDIYANAA ILAA MAHZOOR\nwe stretch not our hands toward the forbidden\nوَلَا نَخْطُوَ بِاَقْدَامِنَا اِلَى مَحْجُورٍ\nWA LAA NAKHTUWA BI-AQDAAMINAA ILAA MAHJOOR\nand stride not with our feet toward the prohibited,\nوَحَتَّى لَا تَعِيَ بُطُونُنَا اِلَّا مَا اَحْلَلْتَ\nWA HATTAA LAA TA'IYA BUTOONUNAA ILLAA MAA AHLALT\nour bellies hold only what You have made lawful\nوَلَا تَنْطِقَ اَلْسِنَتُنَا اِلَّا بِمَا مَثَّلْتَ\nWA LAA TANTIQA ALSINATUNAA ILLAA BIMAA MATHTHALT\nand our tongues speak only what You have exemplified,\nوَلَا نَتَكَلَّفَ اِلَّا مَا يُدْنِي مِنْ ثَوَابِكَ\nWA LAA NATAKALLAFA ILLAA MAA YUDNEE MIN THAWAABIK\nwe undertake nothing but what brings close to Your reward\nوَلَا نَتَعَاطَى اِلَّا الَّذِي يَقِي مِنْ عِقَابِكَ\nWA LAA NATA'AATAA ILLAL LADHEE YAQEE MIN I'QAABIK\nand pursue nothing but what protects from Your punishment!\nثُمَّ خَلِّصْ ذَلِكَ كُلَّهٗ مِنْ رِئَاءِ الْمُرَاءِينَ، وَسُمْعَةِ الْمُسْمِعِينَ\nTHUMMA KHALLIS DHAALIKA KULLAHOO MIN RI'AA'IL MURAA'EENA WA SUM'ATIL MUSMI'EEN\nThen rid all of that from the false show of the false showers and the fame seeking of the fame seekers,\nلَا نُشْرِكُ فِيهِ اَحَداً دُونَكَ\nLAA NUSHRIKU FEEHI AHADAN DOONAK\nlest we associate therein anything with You\nوَلَا نَبْتَغِي فِيهِ مُرَاداً سِوَاكَ\nWA LAA NABTAGHEE FEEHI MURAADAN SIWAAK\nor seek therein any object of desire but You!\nاللَّهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِهِ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALIH\nO God, bless Muhammad and his Household,\nوَقِفْنَا فِيهِ عَلَى مَوَاقِيتِ\nWA QIFNAA FEEHI A'LAA MAWAAQEET\nin it make us attend to the appointed moments\nالصَّلَوَاتِ الْخَمْسِ بِحُدُودِهَا الَّتِي حَدَّدْتَ\nAS-SALAWAATIL KHAMSI BIHUDOODIHAL LATEE HADDADT\nof the five prayers within the bounds You have set,\nوَفُرُوضِهَا الَّتِي فَرَضْتَ، وَوَظَائِفِهَا الَّتِي وَظَّفْتَ\nWA FUROODIHAL LATEE FARADTA WA WAZAA'IFIHAL LATEE WAZZAFT\nthe obligations You have decreed, the duties You have assigned,\nوَاَوْقَاتِهَا الَّتِي وَقَّتَّ\nWA AWQAATIHAL LATEE WAQQATT\nand the times You have specified;\nوَاَنْزِلْنَا فِيهَا مَنْزِلَةَ الْمُصِيبِينَ لِمَنَازِلِهَا\nWA ANZILNAA FEEHAA MANZILATAL MUSEEBEENA LIMANAAZILIHAA\nand in the prayers make us alight in the station of the keepers of their stations,\nالْحَافِظِينَ لِاَرْكَانِهَا، الْمُؤَدِّينَ لَهَا\nAL-HAAFIZEENA LI-ARKAANIHAL MU'ADDEENA LAHAA\nthe guardians of their pillars, their performers in their times,\nفِي اَوْقَاتِهَا عَلَى مَا سَنَّهٗ عَبْدُكَ وَرَسُولُكَ صَلَوَاتُكَ عَلَيْهِ وَاٰلِهِ\nFEE AWQAATIHAA A'LAA MAA SANNAHOO A'BDUKA WA RASOOLUKA SALAWAATUKA A'LAYHI WA AALIH\nas Your servant and Your messenger set down in his Sunna (Your blessings be upon him and his Household)\nفِي رُكُوعِهَا وَسُجُودِهَا وَجَمِيعِ فَوَاضِلِهَا\nFEE RUKOO'IHAA WA SUJOODIHAA WA JAMEE'I FAWAADILIHAA\nin their bowings, their prostrations, and all their excellent acts,\nعَلَى اَتَمِّ الطَّهُورِ وَاَسْبَغِهٖ، وَاَبْيَنِ الْخُشُوعِ وَاَبْلَغِهٖ\nA'LAA ATAMMIT TAHOORI WA ASBAGHIHEE WA ABYANIL KHUSHOO'I WA ABLAGHIH\nwith the most complete and ample ritual purity and the most evident and intense humility!\nوَوَفِّقْنَا فِيهِ لِاَنْ نَصِلَ اَرْحَامَنَا بِالْبِرِّ وَالصِّلَةِ\nWA WAFFIQNAA FEEHI LI-AN NASILA ARHAAMANAA BIL BIRRI WAS SILAH\nGive us success in this month to tighten our bonds of kin with devotion and gifts,\nوَاَنْ نَتَعَاهَدَ جِيرَانَنَا بِالْاِفْضَالِ وَالْعَطِيَّةِ\nWA AN NATA'AAHADA JEERAANANAA BIL IFDAALI WAL A'TIYYAH\nattend to our neighbours with bestowal and giving,\nوَاَنْ نُخَلِّصَ اَمْوَالَنَا مِنَ التَّبِعَاتِ\nWA AN NUKHALLISA AMWAALANAA MINAT TABI'AAT\nrid our possessions from claims,\nوَاَنْ نُطَهِّرَهَا بِاِخْرَاجِ الزَّكَوَاتِ\nWA AN NUTAHHIRAHAA BI-IKHRAAJIZ ZAKAWAAT\npurify them through paying the alms,\nوَاَنْ نُرَاجِعَ مَنْ هَاجَرَنَا\nWA AN NURAAJI'A MAN HAAJARANAA\ngo back to him who has gone far from us,\nوَاَنْ نُنْصِفَ مَنْ ظَلَمَنَا\nWA AN NUNSIFA MAN ZALAMANAA\ntreat justly him who has wronged us,\nوَاَنْ نُسَالِمَ مَنْ عَادَانَا\nWA AN NUSAALIMA MAN A'ADAANAA\nmake peace with him who shows enmity toward us\nحَاشَى مَنْ عُودِيَ فِيكَ وَلَكَ\nHAASHAA MAN U'OODIYA FEEKA WA LAK\n(except him who is regarded as an enemy in You and for You,\nفَاِنَّهُ الْعَدُوُّ الَّذِي لَا نُوَالِيهِ\nFA-INNAHUL A'DUWWUL LADHEE LAA NUWAALEEH\nfor he is the enemy whom we will not befriend,\nوَالْحِزْبُ الَّذِي لَا نُصَافِيهِ\nWAL HIZBUL LADHEE LAA NUSAAFEEH\nthe party whom we will not hold dear),\nوَاَنْ نَتَقَرَّبَ اِلَيْكَ فِيهِ مِنَ الْاَعْمَالِ الزَّاكِيَةِ بِمَا تُطَهِّرُنَا بِهٖ مِنَ الذُّنُوبِ\nWA AN NATAQARRABA ILAYKA FEEHI MINAL A'MAALIZ ZAAKIYATI BIMAA TUTAHHIRUNAA BIHEE MINADH DHUNOOB\nand seek nearness to You through blameless works which will purify us from sins\nوَتَعْصِمُنَا فِيهِ مِمَّا نَسْتَاْنِفُ مِنَ الْعُيُوبِ\nWA TA'SIMUNAA FEEHI MIMMAA NASTA'NIFU MINAL U'YOOB\nand preserve us from renewing faults,\nحَتَّى لَا يُورِدَ عَلَيْكَ اَحَدٌ مِنْ مَلَائِكَتِكَ\nHATTAA LAA YOORIDA A'LAYKA AHADUN MIN MALAA'IKATIK\nso that none of Your angels will bring for You\nاِلَّا دُونَ مَا نُورِدُ مِنْ اَبْوَابِ الطَّاعَةِ لَكَ، وَاَنْوَاعِ الْقُرْبَةِ اِلَيْكَ\nILLAA DOONA MAA NOORIDU MIN ABWAABIT TAA'ATI LAKA WA ANWAA'IL QURBATI ILAYK\nthe kinds of obedience and sorts of nearness-seeking unless they be less than what we bring!\nاللَّهُمَّ اِنِّي اَسْاَلُكَ بِحَقِّ هَذَا الشَّهْرِ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS'ALUKA BIHAQQI HAADHASH SHAHR\nO God, I ask You by the right of this month\nوَبِحَقِّ مَنْ تَعَبَّدَ لَكَ فِيهِ\nWA BIHAQQI MAN TA'ABBADA LAKA FEEH\nand by the right of him who worships You within it\nمِنِ ابْتِدَائِهٖ اِلَى وَقْتِ فَنَائِهٖ\nMINIB TIDAA'IHEE ILAA WAQTI FANAA'IH\nfrom its beginning to the time of its passing,\nمِنْ مَلَكٍ قَرَّبْتَهٗ، اَوْ نَبِيٍّ اَرْسَلْتَهٗ\nMIN MALAKIN QARRABTAHOO AW NABIYYIN ARSALTAH\nwhether angel You have brought nigh to You, prophet You have sent,\nاَوْ عَبْدٍ صَالِحٍ اخْتَصَصْتَهٗ\nAW A'BDIN SAALIHINIKH TASASTAH\nor righteous servant You have singled out,\nاَنْ تُصَلِّيَ عَلَى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِهِ\nAN TUSALLIYA A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALIH\nthat You bless Muhammad and his Household,\nوَاَهِّلْنَا فِيهِ لِمَا وَعَدْتَ اَوْلِيَاءَكَ مِنْ كَرَامَتِكَ\nWA AHHILNAA FEEHI LIMAA WA'ADTA AWLIYAA'AKA MIN KARAAMATIK\nmake us worthy of the generosity You have promised Your friends,\nوَاَوْجِبْ لَنَا فِيهِ مَا اَوْجَبْتَ لِاَهْلِ الْمُبَالَغَةِ فِي طَاعَتِكَ\nWA AWJIB LANAA FEEHI MAA AWJABTA LI-AHLIL MUBAALAGHATI FEE TAA'ATIK\nmake incumbent for us what You have made incumbent for those who go to great lengths in obeying You,\nوَاجْعَلْنَا فِي نَظْمِ مَنِ اسْتَحَقَّ الرَّفِيعَ الْاَعْلَى بِرَحْمَتِكَ\nWAJ'ALNAA FEE NAZMI MANIS TAHAQQAR RAFEE'AL A'LAA BIRAHMATIK\nand place us in the ranks of those who deserve through Your mercy the highest elevation!\nاللَّهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِهِ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALIH\nO God, bless Muhammad and his Household,\nوَجَنِّبْنَا الْاِلْحَادَ فِي تَوْحِيدِكَ، وَالْتَّقْصِيرَ فِي تَمْجِيدِكَ\nWA JANNIBNAL ILHAADA FEE TAWHEEDIKA WAT TAQSEERA FEE TAMJEEDIK\nturn us aside from deviation in professing Your Unity, falling short in magnifying You,\nوَالشَّكَّ فِي دِينِكَ، وَالْعَمَى عَنْ سَبِيلِكَ، وَالْاِغْفَالَ لِحُرْمَتِكَ\nWASH SHAKKA FEE DEENIKA WAL A'MAA A'N SABEELIKA WAL IGHFAALA LIHURMATIK\nuncertainty in Your religion, blindness toward Your path, heedlessness of Your inviolability,\nوَالِانْخِدَاعَ لِعَدُوِّكَ الشَّيْطَانِ الرَّجِيمِ\nWAL INKHIDAA'A LI-A'DUWWIKASH SHAYTAANIR RAJEEM\nand being deceived by Your enemy, the accursed Satan!\nاللَّهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِهِ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALIH\nO God, bless Muhammad and his Household,\nوَاِذَا كَانَ لَكَ فِي كُلِّ لَيْلَةٍ مِنْ لَيَالِي شَهْرِنَا هَذَا\nWA IDHAA KAANA LAKA FEE KULLI LAYLATIN MIN LAYAALEE SHAHRINAA HAADHAA\nand when in every night of this month's nights\nرِقَابٌ يُعْتِقُهَا عَفْوُكَ، اَوْ يَهَبُهَا صَفْحُكَ\nRIQAABUN YU'TIQUHAA A'FWUKA AW YAHABUHAA SAFHUK\nYou have necks which Your pardon will release and Your forgiveness disregard,\nفَاجْعَلْ رِقَابَنَا مِنْ تِلْكَ الرِّقَابِ\nFAJ'AL RIQAABANAA MIN TILKAR RIQAAB\nplace our necks among those necks\nوَاجْعَلْنَا لِشَهْرِنَا مِنْ خَيْرِ اَهْلٍ وَاَصْحَابٍ\nWAJ'ALNAA LISHAHRINAA MIN KHAYRI AHLIN WA AS-HAAB\nand place us among the best folk and companions of this our month!\nاللَّهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِهِ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALIH\nO God, bless Muhammad and his Household,\nوَامْحَقْ ذُنُوبَنَا مَعَ امِّحَاقِ هِلَالِهِ\nWAMHAQ DHUNOOBANAA MA'AM MIHAAQI HILAALIH\nefface our sins along with the effacing of its crescent moon,\nوَاسْلَخْ عَنَّا تَبِعَاتِنَا مَعَ انْسِلَاخِ اَيَّامِهٖ\nWASLAKH A'NNAA TABI'AATINAA MA'AN SILAAKHI AYYAAMIH\nand make us pass forth from the ill effects of our acts with the passing of its days,\nحَتَّى يَنْقَضِيَ عَنَّا وَقَدْ صَفَّيْتَنَا فِيهِ مِنَ الْخَطِيئَاتِ\nHATTAA YANQADIYA A'NNAA WA QAD SAFFAYTANAA FEEHI MINAL KHATEE'AAT\nuntil it leaves us behind, while within it You have purified us of offenses\nوَاَخْلَصْتَنَا فِيهِ مِنَ السَّيِّئَاتِ\nWA AKHLASTANAA FEEHI MINAS SAYYI'AAT\nand rid us of evil deeds!\nاللَّهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِهِ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALIH\nO God, bless Muhammad and his Household,\nوَاِنْ مِلْنَا فِيهِ فَعَدِّلْنَا، وَاِنْ زُغْنَا فِيهِ فَقَوِّمْنَا\nWA IN MILNAA FEEHI FA'ADDILNAA WA IN ZUGHNAA FEEHI FAQAWWIMNAA\nand should we go off to one side in this month, set us aright; should we swerve, point us straight;\nوَاِنِ اشْتَمَلَ عَلَيْنَا عَدُوُّكَ الشَّيْطَانُ فَاسْتَنْقِذْنَا مِنْهُ\nWA INISH TAMALA A'LAYNAA A'DUWWUKASH SHAYTAANU FASTANQIDHNAA MINH\nand should Your enemy Satan enwrap us, rescue us from him!\nاللَّهُمَّ اشْحَنْهُ بِعِبَادَتِنَا اِيَّاكَ\nALLAAHUMMASH-HANHU BI-I'BAADATINAA IYYAAK\nO God, fill this month with our worship of You,\nوَزَيِّنْ اَوْقَاتَهٗ بِطَاعَتِنَا لَكَ\nWA ZAYYIN AWQAATAHOO BITAA'ATINAA LAK\nadorn its times with our obedience toward You,\nوَاَعِنَّا فِي نَهَارِهٖ عَلَى صِيَامِهٖ\nWA A'INNAA FEE NAHAARIHEE A'LAA SIYAAMIH\nhelp us during its daytime with its fast,\nوَفِي لَيْلِهٖ عَلَى الصَّلَاةِ\nWA FEE LAYLIHEE A'LAS SALAAH\nand in its night with prayer\nوَالتَّضَرُّعِ اِلَيْكَ، وَالْخُشُوعِ لَكَ\nWAT TADARRU'I ILAYKA WAL KHUSHOO'I LAK\nand pleading toward You, humility toward You,\nوَالذِّلَّةِ بَيْنَ يَدَيْكَ\nWADH DHILLATI BAYNA YADAYK\nand lowliness before You,\nحَتَّى لَا يَشْهَدَ نَهَارُهٗ عَلَيْنَا بِغَفْلَةٍ، وَلَا لَيْلُهٗ بِتَفْرِيطٍ\nHATTAA LAA YASH-HADA NAHAARUHOO A'LAYNAA BIGHAFLATIN WA LAA LAYLUHOO BITAFREET\nso that its daytime may not bear witness against our heedlessness, nor its night against our neglect!\nاللَّهُمَّ وَاجْعَلْنَا فِي سَائِرِ الشُّهُورِ وَالْاَيَّامِ كَذَلِكَ مَا عَمَّرْتَنَا\nALLAAHUMMA WAJ'ALNAA FEE SAA'IRISH SHUHOORI WAL AYYAAMI KADHAALIKA MAA A'MMARTANAA\nO God, make us like this in the other months and days as long as You give us life,\nوَاجْعَلْنَا مِنْ عِبَادِكَ الصَّالِحِينَ\nWAJ'ALNAA MIN I'BAADIKAS SAALIHEEN\nand place us among Your righteous servants,\nالَّذِينَ يَرِثُونَ الْفِرْدَوْسَ هُمْ فِيهَا خَالِدُونَ\nALLADHEENA YARITHOONAL FIRDAWSA HUM FEEHAA KHAALIDOON\n\"those who shall inherit Paradise, therein dwelling forever\" (23:11),\nوَالَّذِينَ يُؤْتُونَ مَا اٰتَوْا وَقُلُوبُهُمْ\nWAL LADHEENA YU'TOONA MAA AATAW WA QULOOBUHUM\n\"those who give what they give, while their hearts quake,\nوَجِلَةٌ، اَنَّهُمْ اِلَى رَبِّهِمْ رَاجِعُونَ\nWAJILATUN ANNAHUM ILAA RABBIHIM RAAJI'OON\nthat they are returning to their Lord\" (23:60),\nوَمِنَ الَّذِينَ يُسَارِعُونَ فِي الْخَيْرَاتِ وَهُمْ لَهَا سَابِقُونَ\nWA MINAL LADHEENA YUSAARI'OONA FIL KHAYRAATI WA HUM LAHAA SAABIQOON\nthose who \"..vie in good works, outracing to them\" (23:61)!\nاللَّهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِهِ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALIH\nO God, bless Muhammad and his Household\nفِي كُلِّ وَقْتٍ وَكُلِّ اَوَانٍ وَعَلَى كُلِّ حَالٍ\nFEE KULLI WAQTIN WA KULLI AWAANIN WA A'LAA KULLI HAAL\nin every time, in all moments, and in every state,\nعَدَدَ مَا صَلَّيْتَ عَلَى مَنْ صَلَّيْتَ عَلَيْهِ\nA'DADA MAA SALLAYTA A'LAA MAN SALLAYTA A'LAYH\nto the number that You have blessed whomsoever You have blessed\nوَاَضْعَافَ ذَلِكَ كُلِّهٖ بِالْاَضْعَافِ\nWA AD'AAFA DHAALIKA KULLIHEE BIL AD'AAF\nand to multiples of all that, through multiples\nالَّتِي لَا يُحْصِيهَا غَيْرُكَ\nALLATEE LAA YUHSEEHAA GHAYRUK\nwhich none can count but You!\nاِنَّكَ فَعَّالٌ لِمَا تُرِيدُ\nINNAKA FA''AALUN LIMAA TUREED\nSurely You are Accomplisher of what You desire.",
  "merits": "The forty-fourth supplication of al-Sahifah al-Kamilah al-Sajjadiyyah, Imam Zayn al-Abidin (a.s.)'s supplication for the coming of the month of Ramadan. It is among the acts of the [first night of Ramazan](AA22)."
